<title>USA: No major cold in sight in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</title>
<headline>No major cold in sight in Brazil coffee areas -WSC.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>No major cold is in sight over the next three to five days in Brazil's coffee regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation (WSC) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The forecast is for mild and dry weather on Monday and Tuesday, with lows of 52-62 degrees.</p>
</text>
